{"seq":4,"slug":"runtime-validation","title":"运行时类型检查与 Pydantic","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/runtime-validation","wordCount":913,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"运行时类型检查与-pydantic\">运行时类型检查与 Pydantic</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Python 的标准类型标注在运行时不会被强制执行——它们仅是&quot;提示&quot;。然而在 API 输入校验、配置解析、数据序列化等场景中，运行时类型验证不可或缺。Pydantic 是 Python 生态中最流行的运行时验证库，以类型标注为基础，提供高性能数据解析与校验能力。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>静态检查只能保护代码<strong>内部</strong>的一致性，无法阻止外部数据（用户输入、第三方响应、配置文件）在运行时携带非法值。运行时验证的作用就是在系统边界把住入口。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>静态检查（mypy）</th>\n<th>运行时验证（Pydantic）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生效时机</td>\n<td>开发期 / CI</td>\n<td>程序运行期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖数据</td>\n<td>代码内部</td>\n<td>外部边界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败表现</td>\n<td>检查器报错</td>\n<td>抛出 ValidationError</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行开销</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>解析与校验成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Pydantic V2 有三条主线：<strong>模型</strong>（<code>BaseModel</code> 定义结构）、<strong>校验器</strong>（字段级 / 模型级钩子）、<strong>序列化</strong>（<code>model_dump</code> / <code>model_validate</code> 双向转换）。默认开启宽松模式（lax mode）会做自动类型转换，把 <code>&quot;25&quot;</code> 转成 <code>25</code>。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"运行时验证的必要性\">运行时验证的必要性</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>风险</th>\n<th>验证手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>REST API 输入</td>\n<td>用户提交非法数据</td>\n<td>Pydantic / marshmallow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>配置文件解析</td>\n<td>YAML/JSON 字段缺失或类型错误</td>\n<td>Pydantic Settings</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外部数据集成</td>\n<td>第三方系统返回脏数据</td>\n<td>模型校验 + 异常捕获</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CLI 参数</td>\n<td>用户输入格式错误</td>\n<td>typer + 类型验证</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pydantic-v2-核心用法\">Pydantic V2 核心用法</h2><h3 id=\"basemodel-定义\">BaseModel 定义</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pydantic import BaseModel, Field&#10;from datetime import datetime&#10;&#10;class User(BaseModel):&#10;    name: str = Field(min_length=1, max_length=50)&#10;    age: int = Field(ge=0, le=150)&#10;    email: str&#10;    created_at: datetime = Field(default_factory=datetime.now)&#10;&#10;user = User(name=&quot;Alice&quot;, age=30, email=&quot;alice@example.com&quot;)&#10;print(user.model_dump())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pydantic </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BaseModel, Field</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> datetime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> datetime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> User</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BaseModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Field(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">min_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">max_length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">50</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Field(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ge</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">le</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">150</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    email: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    created_at: datetime </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Field(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">default_factory</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">datetime.now)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"alice@example.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user.model_dump())</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"自动类型转换\">自动类型转换</h3><p>Pydantic 默认开启&quot;宽松模式&quot;（lax mode），会尝试将输入数据转换为目标类型：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"user = User(name=&quot;Bob&quot;, age=&quot;25&quot;, email=&quot;bob@test.com&quot;)&#10;print(user.age)        # 25（int，从 str 自动转换）&#10;print(type(user.age))  # &lt;class &#39;int&#39;&gt;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"25\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bob@test.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user.age)        </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 25（int，从 str 自动转换）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">type</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user.age))  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># &#x3C;class 'int'></span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"校验器-validator\">校验器（Validator）</h2><h3 id=\"字段校验器\">字段校验器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pydantic import BaseModel, field_validator&#10;&#10;class Product(BaseModel):&#10;    name: str&#10;    price: float&#10;    sku: str&#10;&#10;    @field_validator(&quot;sku&quot;)&#10;    @classmethod&#10;    def validate_sku(cls, v: str) -&gt; str:&#10;        if not v.startswith(&quot;SKU-&quot;):&#10;            raise ValueError(&quot;SKU must start with &#39;SKU-&#39;&quot;)&#10;        return v.upper()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pydantic </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BaseModel, field_validator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Product</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BaseModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    price: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">float</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sku: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @field_validator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"sku\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">classmethod</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> validate_sku</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cls, v: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> not</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v.startswith(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU-\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            raise</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ValueError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"SKU must start with 'SKU-'\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> v.upper()</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"模型校验器\">模型校验器</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pydantic import BaseModel, model_validator&#10;&#10;class DateRange(BaseModel):&#10;    start: datetime&#10;    end: datetime&#10;&#10;    @model_validator(mode=&quot;after&quot;)&#10;    def check_order(self) -&gt; &quot;DateRange&quot;:&#10;        if self.start &gt;= self.end:&#10;            raise ValueError(&quot;start must be before end&quot;)&#10;        return self\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pydantic </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BaseModel, model_validator</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DateRange</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BaseModel</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    start: datetime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    end: datetime</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    @model_validator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">mode</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"after\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_order</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"DateRange\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.end:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            raise</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> ValueError</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"start must be before end\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"校验器类型对比\">校验器类型对比</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>校验器类型</th>\n<th>装饰器</th>\n<th>作用范围</th>\n<th>执行时机</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字段校验（前）</td>\n<td><code>field_validator</code></td>\n<td>单个字段</td>\n<td>类型转换前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段校验（后）</td>\n<td><code>field_validator</code></td>\n<td>单个字段</td>\n<td>类型转换后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型校验（前）</td>\n<td><code>model_validator</code></td>\n<td>整个模型</td>\n<td>字段校验前</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>模型校验（后）</td>\n<td><code>model_validator</code></td>\n<td>整个模型</td>\n<td>字段校验后</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"序列化与反序列化\">序列化与反序列化</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"user = User(name=&quot;Alice&quot;, age=30, email=&quot;a@b.com&quot;)&#10;&#10;json_str = user.model_dump_json()&#10;user_dict = user.model_dump(exclude={&quot;created_at&quot;})&#10;&#10;user2 = User.model_validate_json(json_str)&#10;user3 = User.model_validate({&quot;name&quot;: &quot;Bob&quot;, &quot;age&quot;: 25, &quot;email&quot;: &quot;b@c.com&quot;})\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Alice\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">age</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">email</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"a@b.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">json_str </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user.model_dump_json()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user_dict </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user.model_dump(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">exclude</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"created_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User.model_validate_json(json_str)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user3 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> User.model_validate({</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Bob\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"age\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"email\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"b@c.com\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">})</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>方向</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>model_dump()</code></td>\n<td>模型 → 字典</td>\n<td>Model</td>\n<td>dict</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>model_dump_json()</code></td>\n<td>模型 → JSON</td>\n<td>Model</td>\n<td>str</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>model_validate()</code></td>\n<td>字典 → 模型</td>\n<td>dict</td>\n<td>Model</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>model_validate_json()</code></td>\n<td>JSON → 模型</td>\n<td>str</td>\n<td>Model</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"pydantic-settings\">Pydantic Settings</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from pydantic_settings import BaseSettings&#10;&#10;class AppConfig(BaseSettings):&#10;    database_url: str&#10;    redis_host: str = &quot;localhost&quot;&#10;    debug: bool = False&#10;&#10;    model_config = {&quot;env_prefix&quot;: &quot;APP_&quot;}&#10;&#10;config = AppConfig()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pydantic_settings </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> BaseSettings</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> AppConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">BaseSettings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    database_url: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    redis_host: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"localhost\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    debug: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> False</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model_config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"env_prefix\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"APP_\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">config </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AppConfig()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>运行时从环境变量 <code>APP_DATABASE_URL</code>、<code>APP_REDIS_HOST</code> 等自动读取并校验。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"其他运行时验证方案\">其他运行时验证方案</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Pydantic V2</td>\n<td>Rust 内核、功能全面</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>API / 配置 / ORM</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>attrs + cattrs</td>\n<td>轻量、与 attrs 生态集成</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>内部数据结构</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>beartype</td>\n<td>零开销装饰器式检查</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>函数入参快速守卫</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>typeguard</td>\n<td>运行时全面检查</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>调试和测试环境</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>msgspec</td>\n<td>极致性能的序列化 + 校验</td>\n<td>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</td>\n<td>高吞吐 JSON 处理</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;  A[类型标注] --&gt; B{运行时需要验证?}&#10;  B -- 是 --&gt; C{场景}&#10;  C -- API/配置 --&gt; D[Pydantic]&#10;  C -- 函数守卫 --&gt; E[beartype]&#10;  C -- 高性能序列化 --&gt; F[msgspec]&#10;  B -- 否 --&gt; G[仅静态检查 mypy]\">graph LR\n  A[类型标注] --&gt; B{运行时需要验证?}\n  B -- 是 --&gt; C{场景}\n  C -- API/配置 --&gt; D[Pydantic]\n  C -- 函数守卫 --&gt; E[beartype]\n  C -- 高性能序列化 --&gt; F[msgspec]\n  B -- 否 --&gt; G[仅静态检查 mypy]</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>在系统边界（API 入口、外部数据源）使用 Pydantic 做验证，内部逻辑依赖静态检查</li>\n<li>优先使用 Pydantic V2 的 <code>model_config</code> 替代 V1 的 <code>class Config</code></li>\n<li>对性能敏感的热路径考虑 msgspec 或 beartype</li>\n<li>将 Pydantic 模型作为 DTO（数据传输对象），与领域模型分离</li>\n<li>使用 <code>model_json_schema()</code> 自动生成 JSON Schema 用于文档和前端校验</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>静态检查保护代码内部，运行时验证守住系统边界，两者互补而非替代。</li>\n<li>Pydantic V2 以 Rust 内核提供高性能解析，围绕模型、校验器、序列化三条主线组织。</li>\n<li><code>field_validator</code> 做字段级校验，<code>model_validator</code> 做跨字段校验，执行时机分类型转换前后。</li>\n<li><code>model_dump</code> / <code>model_validate</code> 及其 JSON 变体构成序列化与反序列化的对称接口。</li>\n<li><code>BaseSettings</code> 把环境变量解析与校验统一到同一套模型定义中。</li>\n<li>在 API 入口、外部数据源处校验；对性能敏感的热路径可换用 beartype 或 msgspec。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"运行时类型检查与 Pydantic","id":"运行时类型检查与-pydantic"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"运行时验证的必要性","id":"运行时验证的必要性"},{"level":2,"text":"Pydantic V2 核心用法","id":"pydantic-v2-核心用法"},{"level":3,"text":"BaseModel 定义","id":"basemodel-定义"},{"level":3,"text":"自动类型转换","id":"自动类型转换"},{"level":2,"text":"校验器（Validator）","id":"校验器-validator"},{"level":3,"text":"字段校验器","id":"字段校验器"},{"level":3,"text":"模型校验器","id":"模型校验器"},{"level":3,"text":"校验器类型对比","id":"校验器类型对比"},{"level":2,"text":"序列化与反序列化","id":"序列化与反序列化"},{"level":2,"text":"Pydantic Settings","id":"pydantic-settings"},{"level":2,"text":"其他运行时验证方案","id":"其他运行时验证方案"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"泛型与 TypeVar","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/generics"},"next":{"title":"asyncio 事件循环","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/async-programming/asyncio-event-loop"}}